  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal Partner Cooperative Agreement - Year 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This partnership between The Action Council Association (ACA) and USADF is aimed at providing comprehensive support to grantees of the United States African Development Foundation (USADF) throughout their project implementation process. The Action Council Association (ACA), a non-profit organization based in Senegal, will provide technical assistance to beneficiary groups of the United States African Development Foundation (USADF) across Senegal. ACA will offer tailored grant design, implementation support, and technical assistance to meet the unique needs of each beneficiary group. This collaboration will help grantees overcome challenges, execute their projects successfully, achieve their desired outcomes, and attain long-term sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
